1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,400
Welcome home! You must be tired.
What's your name, friend?

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:08,233
Rule two. Never give your name. Not
even a nickname. A name is a key.

3
00:00:08,733 --> 00:00:12,733
So you say nothing. He smiles wider.
And his smile doesn't change at all.
